extends UnitBase
class_name ScoutVehicle

## Light reconnaissance vehicle: an open-topped wheeled car with a
## machine gun. Its job is information - it is the fastest vehicle in the
## game and sees nearly twice as far as anything else - plus harassment:
## the MG shreds infantry and it can run them over, but its light armour
## and small-arms gun lose to any real vehicle.
##
## It carries no troops. Behaviour is identical to UnitBase; everything
## that makes it a scout is in config/units/scout_vehicle.tres. If a
## personnel carrier is ever wanted it should be its own unit built on
## OccupantHold (the garrison core), not a second job for this one.
